      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Contamination OCD isn't always about bacteria or illness.\n\nSome people
    experience an intense feeling of being dirty without any visible contamination.
    Others worry about spreading contamination to people or objects around them.\n\nCompulsions
    may involve repeated washing, avoiding certain objects, changing clothes, or
    seeking reassurance.\n\nThese behaviours aren't simply habits or preferences.
    They can be attempts to reduce overwhelming anxiety and uncertainty.\r\n\nThe
    goal isn't to feel completely certain that nothing bad will happen.\n\nIt's learning
    that uncertainty can be tolerated without repeating the ritual.\n\n\n\n\n\n\r\nClick
    anywhere to close.\r\n  "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
